 "notes": [
  "Stadhouderskade 12 (BAG pand 0363100012090765, built 1974; ordinary-backlog-20261120 row 6, generic today). Lane large-buildings-20261120 round 3. Photographed: the NW front (w03-337L 2021-03-24, straight: tower left, the base with French balconies and red awnings), the SE front (w01-157 2024-12-11, 47 degrees: the six-storey base and the tower over it) and the SW side (w02-247 2021-03-24, 47 degrees).",
  "walls[0] = surface 101 (NW, 22.9 m, to 32.5 m: tower and base flush) and walls[2] = surface 139 (SE, 22.9 m, to 32.5 m) as 10 storeys x 7 bays with grey floor bands; walls[1] = surface 66 and walls[3] = surface 202 the six-storey base beside them (aligned); walls[4] = S surfaces 206/23 and walls[5] = SW surfaces 115/122/166, six storeys. Brick #8c6e56 and bands #8e8979 sampled from w01-157. Simplified: the French balconies (flush bar rails; the kit's balconies stand proud as cream slabs, tried and dropped), the red-capped dormer bays, the awnings, the set-back top of the tower (3DBAG roof). Not drawn: the low SW range (surfaces 63/36, 7.6 m) and the tower's set-back upper faces (shader grid)."
 ]
